        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1826] In scheduled control mode within the context of the AC_ChargeLoopRes the elements EVSETargetActivePower and EVSETargetReactivePower shall only be used by the SECC in situations where the technical requirements of the local grid code mandate such ad-hoc interference with the EV's power profile.",
            "block_bbox": [
